{"script":"m_3_6_2_1","des":"众人来到大市集，对这里的繁荣感到惊讶。","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"摊贩的商人","text":"[show]上好的防具啊！由坚韧的甲猪厚皮制成，来自遥远又危险的的白沙荒原！走过路过千万不要错过！快来看，快来买啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"店门口的商人","text":"[show]从索利德山进口的土豆！买一送一，买一送一！错过机会就没有了，先到先得，先到先得啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哇，这里就是大市集……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"event":"GAoEvent","eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara002_2\": \"05\"\r    }\r  },\r  \"action\": \"bubble\"\r}"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]走街串巷到处都是人，耳边的吆喝声也从没停过，比驿站还要繁华好多好多！太热闹啦——！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"sca